1
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,239
Don't worry.

2
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:03,000
This operation...

3
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,519
...isn't just about the Nanhai drug network.

4
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,599
I now feel that what we've uncovered

5
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:12,240
might only be the tip of the iceberg.

6
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:21,319
Then we'll dive beneath the iceberg

7
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:24,280
and root out all these drug dealers.

8
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:35,960
Captain...

9
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:38,800
I want to get back on the front line.

10
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,080
Captain Bai,

11
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,719
the Ring Expressway arson case is still unclear,

12
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:46,840
and the Longze Group's security team is involved.

13
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:49,879
It's really not enough with just He Bo and me.

14
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,960
So I was thinking...

15
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:52,599
could we have Zhuang Yan

16
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:54,120
transferred to our operations team?

17
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:01,439
Since when did your skills slip so badly?

18
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,080
Captain Bai,

19
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:06,520
word from the hospital says

20
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,199
Qin Hao is out of critical danger,

21
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,199
but he's still in a coma.

22
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,000
Notify the hospital.

23
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,199
The moment the suspect wakes up,

24
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,199
interrogate him immediately.

25
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,120
I'll interrogate him myself.

26
00:03:13,159 --> 00:03:13,680
Yes, sir.

27
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,520
Captain,

28
00:03:21,479 --> 00:03:22,360
I want to help.

29
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,360
Thanks.

30
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,280
I could use your help too.

31
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,840
But whether you can get back on the front line

32
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:29,319
still depends on you.

33
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,039
Understood.

34
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,639
Captain.

35
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:36,400
Is it important?

36
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,400
Yes.

37
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,360
Captain Lu.

38
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:50,560
Zhuang Yan.

39
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:52,840
You haven't turned in your gun yet, have you?

40
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,680
I'll hand it over right now.

41
00:04:32,879 --> 00:04:34,319
Give him some time.

42
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,040
Here.

43
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:06,000
Sign this.

44
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,439
Young man,

45
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,160
don't lose heart.

46
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,680
Do a good job.

47
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,680
You'll still have a chance at the front lines.

48
00:05:23,759 --> 00:05:24,279
Zhuang Yan.

49
00:05:36,639 --> 00:05:38,240
With performance evaluations going on lately,

50
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:40,199
I'm running back and forth every day

51
00:05:40,199 --> 00:05:41,800
between the municipal bureau and higher departments,

52
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,120
picking up files, dropping off files,

53
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:45,560
dropping off files, picking up files...

54
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,839
or stuck at a computer writing press releases.

55
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,240
Suits you well.

56
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,920
Suits me?

57
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,319
If I wear this uniform and don't work the front lines,

58
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:55,879
how is it any different from any other job?

59
00:05:57,639 --> 00:05:58,959
I'm in the same boat,

60
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,480
dealing with paperwork every day.

61
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:03,959
Still not happy about it?

62
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,439
What's the point of being bitter?

63
00:06:16,759 --> 00:06:18,319
You can't even put your strength to use.

64
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,839
Do you regret transferring from CID to Narcotics?

65
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:37,040
No, I don't.

66
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,519
I think Narcotics suits me better than CID.

67
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,000
Drug dealers are all ruthless desperados.

68
00:06:44,319 --> 00:06:45,600
You have to stay safe.

69
00:06:52,199 --> 00:06:53,120
But I know...

70
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,920
you're even tougher than those desperados.

71
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,920
It's been a while since you transferred to narcotics.

72
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:11,600
Why do you think people do drugs?

73
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,040
Maybe...

74
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:17,240
because of emptiness.

75
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,399
Emptiness?

76
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,480
Is emptiness scarier,

77
00:07:27,759 --> 00:07:29,160
or doing drugs?

78
00:08:06,439 --> 00:08:08,360
Boss Ma, the goods are great,

79
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:10,040
but when it comes to the price...

80
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:14,079
I won't make big claims about other places,

81
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:15,680
but here in Bingcheng,

82
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,680
I control over 30 channels right now.

83
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,360
However much stuff you have,

84
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,920
I can move it all.

85
00:08:24,399 --> 00:08:24,879
What do you say

86
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,600
we join forces?

87
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,959
We can definitely build an empire together.

88
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,720
You're quite ambitious, Boss Zhang.

89
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:40,360
I can barely keep up with your pace.

90
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:42,440
Still,

91
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:45,360
since we already agreed on a price,

92
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:46,440
it's not changing.

93
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:49,559
As for future cooperation,

94
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,559
we can talk about that later.

95
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:03,000
You have your bottom line, Boss Ma,

96
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,120
and you stick to your principles.

97
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,840
Then I have nothing more to say.

98
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:31,000
Doing business with Boss Ma is always a pleasure.

99
00:09:32,039 --> 00:09:34,559
Consider us good friends from now on.

100
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,879
I'll take my leave now.

101
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,039
Take care.

102
00:09:46,279 --> 00:09:46,879
Boss,

103
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,919
do you think Boss Zhang is reliable?

104
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:51,440
We can't use the Bingcheng route anymore.

105
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:52,919
Boss,

106
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:54,799
something went wrong in Nanhai.

107
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,480
When Wu Liang was making the deal with Boss Qin,

108
00:09:57,519 --> 00:09:58,559
they were raided by the police.

109
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:00,279
Wu Liang is missing,

110
00:10:00,519 --> 00:10:01,720
and Boss Qin is critically injured.

111
00:10:01,919 --> 00:10:03,879
He's in the hospital now under police surveillance.

112
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:04,960
Boss,

113
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,279
should we head back?

114
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,039
No need.

115
00:10:07,799 --> 00:10:09,159
Call Geng Hao.

116
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,679
Let him handle this matter.

117
00:10:10,799 --> 00:10:11,879
All right, let's go.

118
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,600
Right.

119
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,399
As long as you're safe.

120
00:10:17,639 --> 00:10:18,639
Lay low for a while.

121
00:10:18,919 --> 00:10:19,639
Wait for my word.

122
00:10:20,519 --> 00:10:21,320
Be careful with everything.

123
00:10:21,919 --> 00:10:22,440
Got it.

124
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:42,639
Hello.

125
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,279
Looking to get your car fixed?

126
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:45,600
Is Wang Deming here?

127
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:46,519
Looking for our boss?

128
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,879
He doesn't work on cars himself.

129
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:50,279
Just tell him

130
00:10:50,519 --> 00:10:51,720
Old Dai sent us.

131
00:10:52,039 --> 00:10:52,600
All right.

132
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,159
Captain Lu asked me to give you these files.

133
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:16,519
Got it. Right away.

134
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:17,679
Wang Zhen.

135
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,399
The Criminal Investigation team is short-handed.

136
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:21,519
Captain Lu told us to watch Qin Hao at Xincheng Hospital.

137
00:11:21,559 --> 00:11:22,080
Alright.

138
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,480
You two...

139
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:44,080
were referred by Old Dai?

140
00:11:50,519 --> 00:11:51,080
Take a seat.

141
00:11:59,120 --> 00:11:59,720
Officers...

142
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,399
I don't do drugs.

143
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:02,919
Wang Deming.

144
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,879
We're here to ask you a few questions.

145
00:12:07,519 --> 00:12:09,840
Have you seen this white car?

146
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,399
Volkswagen CC.

147
00:12:11,519 --> 00:12:13,360
I run an auto shop, so of course I know it.

148
00:12:13,519 --> 00:12:14,320
Look closer.

149
00:12:15,159 --> 00:12:16,360
The plate on this car...

150
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,360
looks familiar, doesn't it?

151
00:12:18,799 --> 00:12:20,480
I'm not really sure about that.

152
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,600
You're not sure?

153
00:12:24,639 --> 00:12:26,399
Well, we know all about you.

154
00:12:26,559 --> 00:12:28,120
Illegally making cloned plates...

155
00:12:28,759 --> 00:12:30,200
That's enough to put you in prison.

156
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,000
We'll settle that with you later.

157
00:12:32,679 --> 00:12:34,240
Right now, you'd better cooperate.

158
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,039
Take a good look.

159
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:39,960
Officers...

160
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,039
I... I just made one license plate for a guy.

161
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,960
I really don't know anything else.

162
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:44,960
Cut the crap.

163
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,399
Just answer what you're asked.

164
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,720
Right, okay, okay.

165
00:12:47,879 --> 00:12:48,679
Go ahead and ask.

166
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:49,720
I'll definitely cooperate.

167
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:52,240
The guy who ordered this cloned plate,

168
00:12:52,879 --> 00:12:53,559
what did he look like?

169
00:12:54,399 --> 00:12:55,840
What did he look like?

170
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,360
I can't quite remember that.

171
00:12:57,679 --> 00:13:00,039
Th-this plate, I remember.

172
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,120
This car...

173
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,960
came by my shop just a couple of days ago.

174
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,200
Got a new plate swapped on.

175
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,320
Still...

176
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,600
I was pretty puzzled at the time.

177
00:13:07,759 --> 00:13:09,879
Wondering why he changed plates again so soon.

178
00:13:09,879 --> 00:13:10,480
Turns out...

179
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,399
he... he's mixed up in a case.

180
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:15,080
What's the new fake plate number you made?

181
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:19,240
Speak up!

182
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,559
I'll talk, I'll talk!

183
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,519
Just give me a second.

184
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:32,720
That's the one.

185
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,360
BQ947.

186
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:35,679
Are you sure?

187
00:13:35,799 --> 00:13:36,360
Positive.

188
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,759
This is He Bo.

189
00:13:43,039 --> 00:13:44,519
Have the traffic police immediately search

190
00:13:44,679 --> 00:13:46,720
for the suspect vehicle, plate BQ947.

191
00:13:56,919 --> 00:13:57,720
What are you doing here?

192
00:13:58,159 --> 00:13:59,159
The boss sent me to check in.

193
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,039
How is he?

194
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,440
Has the suspect woken up?

195
00:14:01,679 --> 00:14:03,120
He woke up once this morning,

196
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,679
but fell back into a coma shortly after.

197
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:05,480
The doctor said

198
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:07,000
his condition is extremely unstable.

199
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,840
He can't be questioned yet.

200
00:14:11,279 --> 00:14:13,279
Then you two will have to tough it out a bit longer.

201
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:14,879
Have you eaten yet?

202
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:17,440
Waiting for the detectives to relieve us.

203
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:19,000
The squad is so short-staffed right now,

204
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,840
who knows when the next shift will arrive.

205
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:21,799
How about this:

206
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,080
I'll watch him for you.

207
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,080
Go get some food first.

208
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:28,320
Don't you trust me to watch him?

209
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:29,639
You think he's gonna run away?

210
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:31,320
All right then.

211
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:33,120
We'll leave things in your hands.

212
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,559
Go on. Thanks!

213
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:40,440
This Wang Deming...

214
00:14:40,799 --> 00:14:42,600
can't even remember what the guy looks like.

215
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,120
Once we find that Volkswagen,

216
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:49,200
we can catch the Ring Expressway arson suspect.

217
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:53,399
Looks like we're scoring big this time.

218
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,320
Go ahead.

219
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,200
Word from the traffic command center:

220
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:02,879
the car you're looking for

221
00:15:02,879 --> 00:15:04,519
entered Jincheng Avenue ten minutes ago.

222
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,639
Understood. Thanks.

223
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,480
They found it.

224
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:09,960
The suspect vehicle was spotted near Jincheng Avenue.

225
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:11,120
Jincheng Avenue?

226
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:12,039
Yeah.

227
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,320
Xincheng Hospital!

228
00:15:17,519 --> 00:15:19,000
Qin Hao is inside the hospital right now.

229
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:21,320
Alert the captain immediately!

230
00:15:21,519 --> 00:15:22,679
The Ring Expressway arson suspect

231
00:15:22,679 --> 00:15:24,120
is very likely inside the hospital right now.

232
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,480
Excuse me, please let me through.

233
00:16:47,519 --> 00:16:48,960
I need to give the patient an injection.

234
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,720
Why hasn't Dr. Wang been coming in lately?

235
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:07,839
He took some time off.

236
00:17:08,279 --> 00:17:08,880
I'm covering his shift.

237
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:10,799
Don't move!

238
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:20,640
Stop right there!

239
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,440
How are you? Are you okay?

240
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:52,599
Quick, notify Captain Bai.

241
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:34,839
Didn't find anything.

242
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:21,440
Captain Bai, Captain Shen.

243
00:19:22,039 --> 00:19:23,039
I've already tested the drugs.

244
00:19:23,319 --> 00:19:25,160
It's a high dose of Psychedelic Blues and cocaine.

245
00:19:25,319 --> 00:19:26,559
The killer wanted to silence him.

246
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:27,880
Good job.

247
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:31,240
Captain Bai, I...

248
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:33,200
Captain...

249
00:19:35,119 --> 00:19:36,839
Didn't I tell you two to keep watch here?

250
00:19:36,839 --> 00:19:38,079
Why did you leave your post?

251
00:19:44,799 --> 00:19:47,640
The killer is very likely to return to the hospital.

252
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:51,119
You two work with Narcotics to guard Qin Hao.

253
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:52,680
Yes, Captain.

254
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:58,200
Captain Bai, we found the suspect's vehicle.

255
00:19:58,559 --> 00:19:59,880
In a parking lot near the hospital.

256
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:02,000
I'm on my way. Notify Forensics.

257
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,799
You two stay here and keep watch.

258
00:20:06,759 --> 00:20:08,400
Li Xiao, He Bo, with me.

259
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,000
Captain Bai.

260
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:13,240
Why did the suspect get away?

261
00:20:14,759 --> 00:20:15,839
I'll tell you one more time:

262
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:17,799
without my direct permission,

263
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:18,920
you have no authority to act.

264
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:19,519
Understood.

265
00:20:48,559 --> 00:20:49,200
What do you have?

266
00:20:52,279 --> 00:20:54,599
Captain Bai, this car was cleaned thoroughly.

267
00:20:54,599 --> 00:20:56,079
We haven't found any leads so far.

268
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,640
Nor is there any evidence...

269
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:59,240
...linking it to the murder case.

270
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:01,200
However, we lifted some residue...

271
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,720
...of plants and soil from the tires.

272
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:03,960
Once we analyze them back at the lab,

273
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,720
we should know where this car has been.

274
00:21:07,119 --> 00:21:07,440
Good.

275
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:08,519
Captain Bai.

276
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,839
We pulled the surveillance footage.

277
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:23,920
At 5:34 p.m.,

278
00:21:24,279 --> 00:21:25,599
the suspect vehicle entered the parking lot.

279
00:21:25,880 --> 00:21:26,960
The suspect then got out...

280
00:21:27,039 --> 00:21:28,200
...and left via the fire exit.

281
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:29,920
Since the parking lot only has cameras...

282
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:32,799
...installed at the entrances, exits, and elevators,

283
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:35,440
from the moment he entered until he left,

284
