00:40:30,079 --> 00:40:30,639
Understood.

565
00:40:31,480 --> 00:40:32,000
Captain.

566
00:40:33,519 --> 00:40:35,039
Good job. Keep it up.

567
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:38,159
Captain.

568
00:40:43,239 --> 00:40:44,880
I've realized my mistake.

569
00:40:46,079 --> 00:40:47,199
I want to return to the front lines.

570
00:40:47,679 --> 00:40:48,639
Want to catch Wu Liang?

571
00:40:49,039 --> 00:40:49,320
Yes.

572
00:40:54,039 --> 00:40:55,280
But for us,

573
00:40:56,239 --> 00:40:58,159
just admitting your mistake isn't enough.

574
00:40:59,320 --> 00:41:00,480
I need you to provide

575
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:02,000
a reasonable explanation for your actions.

576
00:41:20,719 --> 00:41:21,400
It's nothing.

577
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,039
There's nothing to explain.

578
00:41:29,559 --> 00:41:30,199
Captain.

579
00:41:54,280 --> 00:41:54,920
Zhuang Yan,

580
00:41:55,079 --> 00:41:56,079
can you tell me

581
00:41:57,400 --> 00:41:58,760
why, exactly?

582
00:42:13,599 --> 00:42:14,760
Because of my childhood

583
00:42:16,599 --> 00:42:17,639
Stop hiding!

584
00:42:17,639 --> 00:42:19,199
I know where you are!

585
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:20,280
Come on out!

586
00:42:48,000 --> 00:42:49,039
Let go of me!

587
00:42:49,400 --> 00:42:50,559
Let me go!

588
00:42:52,519 --> 00:42:53,679
Zhuang Yan!

589
00:42:53,760 --> 00:42:54,920
Zhuang Yan!

590
00:42:55,880 --> 00:42:57,400
Help!

591
00:43:01,159 --> 00:43:03,840
Let go of me! Don't touch me!

592
00:43:04,960 --> 00:43:06,480
Help!

593
00:43:09,159 --> 00:43:10,639
Zhuang Yan!

594
00:43:10,920 --> 00:43:12,400
Save me!
